<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5540/5570.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5540/5570.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5540/5570 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Friday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Saturday will be 5555.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bid/offer rates were 5548/5562, with the official dollar rate 5555 from Friday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5489/6089 after 5486/6086.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
